{"path":"types/rank","title":"std::rank","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>rank","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/types/rank","section":"types","kind":"page","summary":"If T is an array type, provides the member constant value equal to the number of dimensions of the array. For any other type, value is 0 .","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/type_traits\">&lt;type_traits&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">class</span> T <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> rank<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>If <code>T</code> is an array type, provides the member constant <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">value</span></code> equal to the number of dimensions of the array. For any other type, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">value</span></code> is <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">​<span class=\"nu0\">0</span>​</span></code>.\n</p><p>If the program adds specializations for <code>std::rank</code><span class=\"t-rev-inl t-since-cxx17\"><span> or <code>std::rank_v</code></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx17\">(since C++17)</span></span></span>, the behavior is undefined.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Helper_variable_template\">Helper variable template</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx17\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">template</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>